OL,3,GNEWSA'End of era' as leisure centre
OL,4,Ademolition begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has started to demolish a leisure
OL,7,Fcentre which served a town for more
OL,8,Fthan 50 years.
OL,10,FGenerations of Hartlepool families
OL,11,Flearned how to swim at Mill House
OL,12,FLeisure Centre on Raby Road and went
OL,13,Ffor community activities but it closed
OL,14,Fits doors in April.
OL,16,FLocal historian Frances Wilson said
OL,17,Fpeople in the town had "many happy
OL,18,Fmemories" of the centre but in recent
OL,19,Fyears it had "become tired".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
