OL,3,GNEWSA'End of era' as leisure centre
OL,4,Ademolition begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FChair of Hartlepool Borough Council's
OL,7,Fneighbourhoods committee Amanda Napper
OL,8,Fsaid Mill House had been a "much-loved"
OL,9,Fpart of the town for five decades but
OL,10,Fthe demolition represented a positive
OL,11,Fmilestone in the town's ongoing
OL,12,Fregeneration.
